{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44756","headline":"送鉴供奉归蜀宁亲 · 灵澈","name":"送鉴供奉归蜀宁亲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林间出定恋庭闱，圣主恩深暂许归。\n双树欲辞金锡冷，四花犹向玉阶飞。\n梁山拂汉分清境，蜀雪和烟惹翠微。\n此去不须求彩服，紫衣全胜老莱衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵澈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}